# Response headers for Cloudflare Pages and Netlify (same file format).
# Private tester release: never indexed, no third parties, nothing leaves the page except
# same-origin requests (connect-src 'self') and user-initiated link clicks.
# Revisit at public launch (docs/TODO.md W-004): remove X-Robots-Tag and review the CSP.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), interest-cohort=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
